              <p text-[10px] text-muted>{t(nav.descKey, nav.desc)}</p>
              <ChevronRight h-4 w-4 text-gray-700 group-hover:text-secondary/>
        </Link> )
  NAV_ITEMS = Drives(/drives,#00f0ff) · Charging(/charging,#10b981) · Analytics(/analytics,#a855f7)
            · Battery(/battery,#f59e0b). i18n keys nav.{x}/nav.{x}Desc. No data/loading/empty/error branches
  in the source itself (it is the inner grid the QuickNavWidget wrapper composes).

